(text "MARK 7 PASSIVE CARRIER / REV A / FIT REVIEW" (at 25 15 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2967f7d7-5ae4-59c5-be27-3dad1b20da37"))
(text "Battery -> Feather JST. ANO -> Feather STEMMA QT. No new charger or power rail.\nDisplay VIN -> Feather 3V3. Display 3Vo stays disconnected.\nSCK = GPIO14, MOSI = GPIO27 (NOT the pins labeled SCK/MO on Feather).\nTFT RST = GPIO32 (NOT Feather RESET). P11 is optional; cable-only firmware still wakes by Reset.\nSolder sockets and wires on carrier; plug the unmodified Feather in last.\nMechanical stack and cable fit require the dummy test before PCB ordering." (at 25 175 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "28b7cc4d-70dd-58fe-916c-b63bf1f8a982")))
